Package: jheem2
Type: Package
Title: Code to set up and run simulations using the JHEEM Engine
Version: 1.11.2
Date: 2026-08-18
Author: Anthony Fojo
Maintainer: Anthony Fojo <anthony.fojo@jhmi.edu>
Description: The engine for the JHEEM (Johns Hopkins Epidemiological and Economic
    Model) family of compartmental models of HIV and STI transmission. Provides
    tools to specify versioned model structures, compile and run them as
    differential-equation simulations, manage surveillance data, map between
    data ontologies, define interventions, and calibrate models to data via
    likelihoods.
License: GPL (>= 2)
Imports: Rcpp (>= 1.0.10), reshape2, deSolve, ggplot2, locations, ggsci, plotly, ungroup
LinkingTo: Rcpp
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Depends: 
    R (>= 2.10)
Suggests: 
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
